@* MainLayoutSider — NoAuth project variant. No Authentication module installed, so there is NO
   AuthorizeView, no CascadingAuthenticationState, and no auth-conditional rendering anywhere
   in this file. Every item renders unconditionally, in the order given by the context.

   The outer <nav class="ux-nav-drawer"> wrapper is the current scaffold's shape. Items use the
   built-in <NavLink> component (not a plain <a>) so the active route gets highlighted
   automatically. *@

<nav class="ux-nav-drawer">
    <ul class="nav flex-column">
        <li class="nav-item"><NavLink class="nav-link" href="/" Match="NavLinkMatch.All">Home</NavLink></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><NavLink class="nav-link" href="/product-list">Product List</NavLink></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><NavLink class="nav-link" href="/order-list">Order List</NavLink></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
